      "title": "Juniper neighborhood microgrant continuity review access checklist",
      "body": "The required preparation is signed conflict form at the review desk at the review desk. The preparation remains required on the approved date unless a later safety revision says otherwise. The grant panel has one eligibility exception for youth-led groups. The exception is informational only and does not waive the signed conflict form. A draft budget table is retained as a distractor.",
